nd I pour "},{"t":"out","s":["H8210"],"a":[2]},{"t":" my "},{"t":"soul","s":["H5315"],"a":[4]},{"t":" within me: That I passed through with the throng; I led them to the "},{"t":"house","s":["H1004"],"a":[10]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"God","s":["H0430"],"a":[11]},{"t":" With the "},{"t":"voice","s":["H6963"],"a":[12]},{"t":" of a joyous shout and "},{"t":"praise","s":["H8426"],"a":[14]},{"t":", The festal "},{"t":"multitude","s":["H1995"],"a":[15]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":5,"text":"Why are you cast down, O my soul? And why are you disquieted within me? Hope in God, for I will yet praise Him For the salvation of His countenance.","tok":[{"t":"Why are you cast "},{"t":"down","s":["H7817"],"a":[1]},{"t":", O my "},{"t":"soul","s":["H5315"],"a":[2]},{"t":"? And why are you "},{"t":"disquieted","s":["H1993"],"a":[3]},{"t":" within me? "},{"t":"Hope","s":["H3176"],"a":[5]},{"t":" in "},{"t":"God","s":["H0430"],"a":[6]},{"t":", for I will yet "},{"t":"praise","s":["H3034"],"a":[9]},{"t":" Him For the salvation of His "},{"t":"countenance","s":["H6440"],"a":[11]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":6,"text":"O my God, my soul is cast down within me; Therefore I remember You From the land of the Jordan and the Hermons, From Mount Mizar.","tok":[{"t":"O my "},{"t":"God","s":["H0430"],"a":[0]},{"t":", my "},{"t":"soul","s":["H5315"],"a":[2]},{"t":" is cast "},{"t":"down","s":["H7817"],"a":[3]},{"t":" within me; Therefore I "},{"t":"remember","s":["H2142"],"a":[6]},{"t":" You From the "},{"t":"land","s":["H0776"],"a":[7]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"Jordan","s":["H3383"],"a":[8]},{"t":" and the Hermons, From Mount "},{"t":"Mizar","s":["H4706"],"a":[11]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":7,"text":"Deep calls unto deep At the sound of Your water spouts; All Your waves and Your billows Pass over me.","tok":[{"t":"Deep","s":["H8415"],"a":[0]},{"t":" "},{"t":"calls","s":["H7121"],"a":[3]},{"t":" unto "},{"t":"deep","s":["H8415"],"a":[2]},{"t":" At the sound of Your water spouts; All Your "},{"t":"waves","s":["H4867"],"a":[7]},{"t":" an